{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"naval-cankered-stud","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Summary\n\nObserved while fixing `royalistic-gorgeable-norwayrat` (the MCP image shipping without\n`acli`). When the `acli` transport binary is absent, the reconciler's bare\n`subprocess.Popen([\"acli\", ...])` (`adapters/jira/acli_subprocess.py`) raises\n`FileNotFoundError`, and `bridge_check_access`'s `STEP_CREATE` catch-all\n(`access_check.py:237-241`) reports it verbatim as\n`reason=exception, detail=\"[Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'acli'\"`.\n\nThat is a raw, untyped leak of an infrastructure fault into the probe verdict. `access_check`\nalready has a typed `TransportUnavailableError` path elsewhere (e.g. `access_check.py:467,486`);\na missing-transport binary should map to that typed \"transport unavailable\" verdict rather than a\nbare `FileNotFoundError` string.\n\nThis is AC #4's *alternative* branch on the parent bug (only strictly required if `acli` were\ndeliberately NOT installed). The parent bug installs `acli`, so this is a **latent robustness /\ngraceful-degradation** improvement, not a live failure — filed so it is not lost.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] When the bridge transport binary (`acli`) is absent/unresolvable, `bridge_check_access`\n      reports a typed `transport_unavailable`-style verdict, not a raw `FileNotFoundError` detail.\n- [ ] A unit test drives the missing-transport path (e.g. PATH without `acli`) and asserts the\n      typed verdict.\n- [ ] No behavior change when `acli` is present.","id":"ac93-8afd-1666-4866","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":["mcp","jira","bridge","robustness"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"bridge_check_access STEP_CREATE surfaces raw FileNotFoundError instead of a typed transport-unavailable verdict"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788022637181421160,"uuid":"a6ab3716-98b7-4b4d-ae71-85ef1451b209"}